# HR Data Dashboard (Excel)

## Overview
This project is an HR Analytics Dashboard built in Microsoft Excel.

## Features
- Employee Count
- Department-wise Analysis
- Gender Analysis
- Salary Analysis
- Attrition Dashboard
- Interactive Pivot Tables and Charts

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers
- Conditional Formatting

